  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.93,
      401.9,
      323.27
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The management, control and administrationsof the Corporation shall subject to the provisions of this Actbe administered by a Board of Management consisting offifteen members elected in accordance with the rules of theCorporation from among persons who shall be leaders in thecommunity and theologians, including the President, twoVice Presidents, two joint Secretaries, the Treasurer, theAssistant Treasurer and Eight Committee Members. One ofthe Joint Secretaries shall be a teacher in the College.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      335.09,
      401.93,
      406.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of Management of the Corporationshall be the Board of Management of the College holdingoffice on the day preceding the date of commencement ofthis Act and which shall hold office until a new Board ofManagement is elected in accordance with the rules of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      419.81,
      401.88,
      445.43
    ],
    "text": "(3) The office bearers of the Corporation shall hold officefor a term of one year and be eligible for re-election.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      460.73,
      305.14,
      472.07
    ],
