    "text": "11.The Corporation shall be able and capable in law toacquire and hold any property, movable or immovable, whichmay become vested in it by virtue of any purchase,subscription, gift, grant, testamentary disposition orotherwise, and all such property shall be held by theCorporation for the purpose of this Act, and subject to therules in force for the time being of the Corporation, with fullpower to sell, mortgage, lease, exchange or otherwise disposeof the same.",
